! XRT-06 RT01(Cat8000v 17.15・据付・変更しない)。XR01 との束(LACP active)。★lacp min-bundle は入れない(入れると RT01 が残りのメンバも止め、XR の最低本数の採点が素通りになる)・RT02 への予備経路(メトリック 1000)。
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.11 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface Loopback1
 description USERS
 ip address 10.10.0.1 255.255.0.0
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface Port-channel1
 description BUNDLE to XR01
 ip address 10.0.1.11 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description BUNDLE member to XR01
 no ip address
 channel-group 1 mode active
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description BUNDLE member to XR01
 no ip address
 channel-group 1 mode active
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description BACKUP to RT02
 ip address 10.0.12.11 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 1000
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0011.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
